@{
ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<div class="min-h-screen xl:px-32">
    <div class="container mx-auto py-20">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 shadow-xl">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8">About AgriConnect</h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-center mb-8">Connecting Agriculture with Green Energy Solutions</p>

            <!-- Section 1: Introduction -->
            <section class="mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">Introduction</h2>
                <p>
                    AgriConnect is a visionary initiative aimed at bridging the gap between sustainable agriculture and green energy solutions. With a mission to revolutionize the agricultural sector in South Africa, AgriConnect offers a digital platform where farmers, green energy experts, and enthusiasts can collaborate, share resources, and innovate in the realms of sustainable farming and renewable energy.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Our platform serves as a digital ecosystem where farmers can showcase their produce and sustainable farming practices while accessing cutting-edge green energy technologies tailored to agricultural needs. By fostering transparency, knowledge exchange, and collaboration, AgriConnect empowers stakeholders to embrace sustainable practices and drive positive change in the agricultural industry.
                </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 2: Mission and Goal -->
            <section class="mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">Mission and Goal</h2>
                <p>
                    At AgriConnect, our mission is to promote sustainable agriculture and renewable energy adoption to ensure a more resilient and environmentally friendly future for farming communities. We believe that by facilitating the integration of green energy solutions with modern farming practices, we can mitigate environmental impact, enhance productivity, and create economic opportunities for farmers.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Our goal is to create a digital hub that empowers farmers to embrace sustainable practices, adopt renewable energy technologies, and thrive in a rapidly changing agricultural landscape. Through our platform, we aim to provide farmers with access to resources, expertise, and market opportunities that enable them to transition towards more sustainable and profitable farming operations.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Ultimately, we envision AgriConnect as a catalyst for positive change in the agricultural sector, driving innovation, fostering collaboration, and promoting environmental stewardship. By connecting agriculture with green energy solutions, we aspire to build a more resilient and sustainable future for farmers, communities, and the planet.
                </p>
            </section>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>
